WEBVTT

01:30.490 --> 01:35.039
[The Heir]

01:35.370 --> 01:37.900
[Episode 28]

01:47.350 --> 01:48.150
Mother.

01:50.150 --> 01:51.310
Why are you here?

01:52.120 --> 01:53.400
The weather's gotten chilly,

01:53.400 --> 01:55.400
so I came to meet you on your way back.

01:58.680 --> 02:01.280
Are you still thinking about
your Fourth Aunt?

02:05.400 --> 02:06.120
Mother,

02:07.230 --> 02:10.000
I should keep hating Tian Jiangyue,

02:10.120 --> 02:10.910
shouldn't I?

02:17.120 --> 02:18.579
For more than 10 years now,

02:19.680 --> 02:22.210
I've been having the same dream
over and over.

02:23.750 --> 02:26.750
In that dream, I keep knocking on
the Li family's door,

02:27.240 --> 02:29.030
as if, once the door opens,

02:30.630 --> 02:32.490
your father would still be alive.

02:34.870 --> 02:36.560
But no matter how hard I knock,

02:36.630 --> 02:38.890
the Li family's door just wouldn't open.

02:39.360 --> 02:41.590
Why have you never told me any of this?

02:43.430 --> 02:45.000
You were too young before.

02:45.280 --> 02:46.560
I was worried

02:46.590 --> 02:48.190
telling you would upset you.

02:49.310 --> 02:51.079
But now that you've grown up,

02:52.680 --> 02:55.140
there's nothing left for me
to hide from you.

02:55.750 --> 02:56.800
Let me tell you—

02:58.030 --> 02:59.240
I hate the Li family.

03:00.750 --> 03:02.430
I even secretly swore

03:03.840 --> 03:04.680
that for the rest of my life,

03:04.680 --> 03:07.680
I'd never set foot
inside the Li family's house again.

03:09.630 --> 03:11.370
But yesterday, the moment I heard

03:11.370 --> 03:12.870
that you and Zhengyou got in trouble

03:12.870 --> 03:14.000
and that you were bullied,

03:14.000 --> 03:15.280
I just rushed into the Li family's house

03:15.280 --> 03:17.079
without even thinking about it.

03:18.710 --> 03:21.560
Only when I was standing in the courtyard
did I realize—

03:21.560 --> 03:24.310
how did I just walk in like that?

03:26.680 --> 03:29.280
But really, it wasn't such a big deal
after all.

03:32.150 --> 03:32.960
Mother.

03:35.310 --> 03:37.310
Everyone in the Li household

03:38.079 --> 03:39.710
seems to be trapped in place

03:40.240 --> 03:41.240
by regret

03:42.360 --> 03:43.590
and resentment.

03:47.190 --> 03:48.150
Yeah.

03:49.430 --> 03:51.829
That's why only by
taking this step forward

03:52.560 --> 03:54.290
can I finally let go of the past.

03:56.710 --> 03:58.310
Let go of the past...

05:11.750 --> 05:12.750
Go on then.

05:14.390 --> 05:16.120
How do you plan to deal with me?

05:17.000 --> 05:19.130
I'll give you time to pack your things.

05:19.560 --> 05:20.750
In an hour,

05:21.360 --> 05:23.560
we'll leave for the western outskirts.

05:24.920 --> 05:26.830
Why don't you take this opportunity

05:26.830 --> 05:28.430
to crush me completely?

05:29.630 --> 05:31.360
Don't you hate me the most?

05:32.870 --> 05:33.680
You're right.

05:35.390 --> 05:36.430
I do hate you.

05:38.600 --> 05:40.800
But I don't want to keep hating anymore.

05:43.560 --> 05:44.960
You've lived with hatred

05:45.390 --> 05:46.800
all these years.

05:48.510 --> 05:51.370
Have you ever truly been happy
for even a single day?

05:53.000 --> 05:54.040
Fourth Aunt,

05:55.159 --> 05:56.830
I'm going to move on now.

05:57.720 --> 05:58.830
From here on out,

06:00.390 --> 06:01.850
take care of yourself too.

06:04.600 --> 06:07.000
You can stop hating
just because you say so,

06:07.270 --> 06:09.330
but I'm not as magnanimous as you are.

06:11.920 --> 06:13.040
Li Zhen!

06:13.430 --> 06:15.160
I'll hate you for the rest of my life.

06:15.160 --> 06:18.420
I'll hate your entire Eighth Branch
for the rest of my life!

07:39.430 --> 07:40.310
This...

07:41.120 --> 07:43.040
Isn't this Shize Ink?

07:43.040 --> 07:44.720
This isn't Shize Ink.

07:45.580 --> 07:47.000
The ink goes down quickly,

07:47.000 --> 07:49.040
the color is glossy and deep black,

07:49.070 --> 07:50.360
the brushwork flows smoothly,

07:50.360 --> 07:52.490
and the ink structure is well-formed.

07:52.510 --> 07:55.310
Its quality is indeed no different from
Shize Ink.

07:57.000 --> 07:59.070
Could this be

07:59.720 --> 08:01.780
reprocessed ink made from Shize Ink?

08:02.560 --> 08:03.950
Reprocessed ink?

08:05.120 --> 08:08.190
Methods of reprocessing ink
are fairly common enough,

08:08.510 --> 08:10.560
but since it's reprocessed,

08:10.720 --> 08:12.920
there are naturally many limitations.

08:13.240 --> 08:15.040
To make reprocessed ink

08:15.040 --> 08:16.120
as good as newly made ink—

08:16.120 --> 08:17.720
that's even more difficult.

08:18.310 --> 08:19.160
Zhen,

08:19.510 --> 08:20.970
how did you manage to do it?

08:22.190 --> 08:23.510
In the past, when making reprocessed ink,

08:23.510 --> 08:25.190
people would try to steam and extract

08:25.190 --> 08:26.600
as much of the spent glue
from the discarded ink as possible,

08:26.600 --> 08:27.750
then add fresh glue

08:27.750 --> 08:29.150
to make a new stick of ink.

08:29.310 --> 08:32.320
But fresh glue and old ink
are difficult to fully blend together,

08:32.320 --> 08:35.120
which makes the ink
brittle and prone to cracking.

08:35.909 --> 08:38.750
However, if you leave behind
a small amount of the old glue

08:38.750 --> 08:41.080
in the discarded ink and use it
as a binding agent

08:41.080 --> 08:42.390
to revive the ink,

08:43.080 --> 08:44.750
then the resulting reprocessed ink

08:44.750 --> 08:47.010
can be equal in quality to newly made ink.

08:47.600 --> 08:48.400
Interesting.

08:48.960 --> 08:50.090
Truly interesting.

08:50.390 --> 08:51.650
Since that's the case,

08:51.720 --> 08:52.600
Steward Shao,

08:52.870 --> 08:54.390
for this new batch of orders,

08:54.390 --> 08:56.150
we'll deliver with reprocessed ink.

08:56.150 --> 08:58.810
Hurry and have the workers
rush the production.

08:59.720 --> 09:02.270
Manager Zhen, Master, Eighth Master Li.

09:02.870 --> 09:05.360
Although the reprocessed ink
has been successfully made,

09:05.360 --> 09:07.360
we've still lost quite a bit of time.

09:07.910 --> 09:09.510
Even if we work day and night,

09:10.000 --> 09:14.260
I'm afraid we still won't be able to
deliver the entire order by the deadline.

09:20.390 --> 09:21.270
Mr. Xiao,

09:21.440 --> 09:22.440
your Master Qi...

09:23.030 --> 09:24.870
Master is sleeping.

09:25.270 --> 09:26.030
Sleeping?

09:26.240 --> 09:28.370
Master saw you were developing new ink

09:28.480 --> 09:30.320
and was worried someone
might come sabotage things again,

09:30.320 --> 09:32.000
so he's barely slept
for the past few days.

09:32.000 --> 09:34.130
He insisted on keeping watch himself.

09:34.750 --> 09:36.150
I've got some invitation cards here

09:36.150 --> 09:38.320
and wanted to trouble him
to deliver them to the ink workshop.

09:38.320 --> 09:39.780
I'll go in and check on him.

10:02.360 --> 10:03.320
What did you say?

10:07.960 --> 10:08.760
What was that?

11:01.120 --> 11:01.840
Benchang!

11:02.480 --> 11:03.150
Benchang.

11:03.720 --> 11:07.250
The workers at Li Ink said
Li Zhen had produced reprocessed ink.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.670
Why panic?

11:10.270 --> 11:12.800
Reprocessed ink isn't anything remarkable.

11:13.320 --> 11:15.080
It's just taking unusable old ink

11:15.080 --> 11:16.320
and refurbishing it.

11:16.670 --> 11:19.080
The ink produced can only be considered
barely usable.

11:19.080 --> 11:20.210
That's not the case.

11:20.480 --> 11:21.630
Those ink-makers said

11:21.630 --> 11:24.200
the quality of their reprocessed ink
is identical to new ink,

11:24.200 --> 11:25.550
or even better.

11:28.080 --> 11:29.540
How is that even possible?

11:29.670 --> 11:31.480
You're just boosting their morale
and diminishing ours.

11:31.480 --> 11:32.550
I'm not...

11:32.960 --> 11:34.020
Taking a step back,

11:35.270 --> 11:36.360
even if Li Zhen

11:36.360 --> 11:38.290
has now produced top-quality ink,

11:38.320 --> 11:39.550
there are only a few days left

11:39.550 --> 11:41.510
before they have to deliver the order.

11:41.510 --> 11:42.750
At this point, nothing they do
will change anything.

11:42.750 --> 11:43.790
You're right!

11:43.910 --> 11:46.030
So it's like
every potter praising his own pot—

11:46.030 --> 11:47.760
simply blowing their own horn.

11:48.080 --> 11:49.080
Eldest Young Master.

11:49.080 --> 11:49.840
I just heard

11:49.840 --> 11:50.910
that Steward Shao of Li Ink

11:50.910 --> 11:52.390
had invited the managers of
all ink workshops

11:52.390 --> 11:53.440
to Li Ink,

11:53.600 --> 11:56.260
saying there's an important matter
to discuss.

11:59.840 --> 12:00.770
Keep an eye here.

12:09.150 --> 12:10.150
Elders.

12:13.200 --> 12:15.330
Regarding the recent events at Li Ink,

12:15.440 --> 12:17.300
I assume you elders already know.

12:18.080 --> 12:19.610
I invited you all here today

12:19.670 --> 12:20.840
because there's something

12:20.840 --> 12:22.170
I want to share with you.

12:22.910 --> 12:23.720
Steward Shao,

12:24.440 --> 12:26.500
please distribute this to everyone.

12:31.790 --> 12:32.600
This is...

12:32.750 --> 12:34.480
The recipe for reprocessed ink?

12:34.480 --> 12:35.280
That's right.

12:35.750 --> 12:36.600
Zhen,

12:36.840 --> 12:38.600
you've improved this recipe?

12:39.390 --> 12:41.590
Third Grandfather, you have a keen eye.

12:41.630 --> 12:43.790
Don't you all find it strange?

12:44.670 --> 12:46.550
Why would the Li family

12:47.720 --> 12:49.720
make such a valuable recipe public?

12:51.390 --> 12:52.790
You Tian family brat.

12:53.480 --> 12:54.870
Get out of here,

12:55.150 --> 12:57.550
-or I'll break your legs!
-Uncle Jingdong.

12:59.440 --> 13:00.550
Eldest Young Master Tian,

13:00.550 --> 13:02.200
you really came uninvited.

13:02.750 --> 13:04.600
Young Master Tian is actually right.

13:04.600 --> 13:06.200
I do have a favor to ask

13:06.320 --> 13:07.840
of you elders.

13:07.870 --> 13:08.670
Zhen,

13:08.790 --> 13:09.870
please go ahead.

13:10.510 --> 13:11.970
I'd like to use this recipe

13:12.080 --> 13:13.790
in exchange for 5 days' use of

13:13.870 --> 13:15.270
each ink workshop and its workers.

13:15.270 --> 13:16.870
To borrow 5 days' use of them?

13:16.960 --> 13:19.670
To assist me in reprocessing Shize Ink.

13:21.840 --> 13:23.150
Li Zhen, oh, Li Zhen.

13:23.440 --> 13:25.370
You really are quite calculating.

13:25.870 --> 13:27.500
Using others' ink workshops
for free for 5 days

13:27.500 --> 13:29.360
to produce ink for your Li family.

13:30.080 --> 13:32.750
How much money will that cost
each of them?

13:32.870 --> 13:36.120
Only borrowing our ink workshops
for 5 days,

13:36.440 --> 13:38.240
but this reprocessing method

13:38.720 --> 13:43.030
can bring the old and discarded ink
in our workshops

13:43.050 --> 13:44.440
back to life.

13:45.960 --> 13:47.120
Whether this deal is worth it or not,

13:47.120 --> 13:49.520
I believe everyone here knows it
very well.

13:50.090 --> 13:51.840
Third Master, you're mistaken.

13:51.840 --> 13:54.100
Take our Tian Ink Workshop as an example.

13:54.240 --> 13:56.960
The Styrax resin ink produced in one day

13:57.790 --> 14:00.390
can easily earn
at least 50 taels of silver.

14:01.200 --> 14:02.030
What a joke.

14:02.320 --> 14:04.120
We earn an honest 20 percent profit

14:04.120 --> 14:06.670
from selling one stick of ink.

14:06.870 --> 14:09.150
But as for your Tian family's
Styrax resin ink—

14:09.150 --> 14:10.870
the production cost is already high,

14:10.870 --> 14:12.480
and under the name of Tribute Ink,

14:12.480 --> 14:16.000
the price is set at more than
5 times the cost.

14:16.030 --> 14:17.790
And even then, 10 percent of the profit

14:17.790 --> 14:20.720
goes straight into the pockets of
ink merchants and tutors.

14:20.720 --> 14:21.550
The bad practice

14:21.550 --> 14:24.600
of compulsory ink usage
in academies before

14:24.750 --> 14:26.960
was also caused by your Tian family!

14:27.000 --> 14:29.530
Who opens a business
without seeking profit?

14:30.030 --> 14:31.390
Our Tian Ink has so many

14:31.390 --> 14:33.850
ink-makers who need to
feed their families.

14:33.870 --> 14:34.750
Of course I have the responsibility

14:34.750 --> 14:37.080
to make sure everyone
can live a good life.

14:39.000 --> 14:40.320
How interesting.

14:40.550 --> 14:41.440
Interesting.

14:42.150 --> 14:43.270
Young Master Tian,

14:43.270 --> 14:45.440
it's one thing you showed up uninvited,

14:45.440 --> 14:48.040
but you even insisted on
getting scolded here.

14:48.320 --> 14:50.270
Isn't that a losing deal for you?

14:50.670 --> 14:53.030
Thank you, elders, for speaking up.

14:54.630 --> 14:57.690
I also have some words to say
from the bottom of my heart.

14:58.080 --> 14:58.960
Ink recipes

14:59.240 --> 15:01.360
are the foundation of each ink workshop.

15:01.360 --> 15:03.840
It's only natural that
they are not passed on to outsiders.

15:03.840 --> 15:04.870
But I think,

15:05.200 --> 15:06.440
if we rigidly stick to old conventions,

15:06.440 --> 15:07.360
in the end,

15:07.360 --> 15:09.490
we'll only bind our own hands and feet.

15:09.550 --> 15:12.350
By making this reprocessed ink recipe
public now,

15:12.630 --> 15:14.320
Li Ink is indeed addressing
an urgent crisis.

15:14.320 --> 15:15.450
But at the same time,

15:15.600 --> 15:17.530
I also hope to use this opportunity

15:18.080 --> 15:19.670
to break down sectarian barriers

15:19.670 --> 15:21.200
and set a new trend,

15:21.360 --> 15:22.720
so as to help our Hui Ink

15:22.910 --> 15:24.440
restore its prosperity.

15:24.600 --> 15:25.600
Well said.

15:30.600 --> 15:31.600
Zhen.

15:32.030 --> 15:34.270
Li Ink offering the reprocessed ink recipe

15:34.270 --> 15:36.670
benefits the entire Huizhou ink industry.

15:36.670 --> 15:40.000
Our Chen Ink is willing to take on
an order of 300 sticks.

15:40.120 --> 15:41.850
Thank you, Third Grandfather.

15:43.360 --> 15:44.120
Everyone,

15:44.630 --> 15:46.560
with me, Chen Jiru, as a guarantor,

15:46.720 --> 15:48.600
you can all rest assured.

15:50.120 --> 15:53.550
Pan Ink is willing to take on 150 sticks.

15:53.910 --> 15:56.000
Thank you, Mr. Pan.

15:56.600 --> 15:59.600
I also dare to guarantee
with Pan Ink's reputation.

15:59.910 --> 16:01.840
You all needn't worry.

16:02.600 --> 16:04.960
Huang Ink will take on 100 sticks.

16:04.960 --> 16:06.910
Yu Ink will take on 50 sticks.

16:07.080 --> 16:07.960
I, Zhen,

16:08.550 --> 16:10.080
thank you all, elders.

16:13.750 --> 16:15.010
Seventh Grandmother.

16:15.270 --> 16:17.510
All the backlogged orders for Shize Ink

16:17.550 --> 16:19.720
have now been delivered on schedule.

16:19.910 --> 16:21.360
Beautifully done.

16:21.870 --> 16:22.960
Zhen,

16:23.550 --> 16:24.960
you've worked hard.

16:25.960 --> 16:27.510
The crisis of Li Ink

16:27.960 --> 16:29.510
has finally been overcome.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.200
Zhen.

16:31.480 --> 16:36.000
You managed to get so many ink workshops
in Huizhou to follow your lead.

16:36.910 --> 16:39.910
What you've brought together
isn't just ink anymore,

16:39.960 --> 16:43.090
but the hearts of the people
in the Huizhou ink industry.

16:48.960 --> 16:49.840
Zhen,

16:49.840 --> 16:51.440
what is this about?

16:51.630 --> 16:52.890
Seventh Grandmother.

16:53.240 --> 16:54.600
This whole series of setbacks

16:54.600 --> 16:56.270
was due to my negligence.

16:57.550 --> 16:59.790
I failed to manage
this household properly,

16:59.790 --> 17:01.660
caused our Li family to lose its cohesion,

17:01.660 --> 17:03.240
and allowed the Tian family
to take advantage,

17:03.240 --> 17:04.770
almost causing a disaster.

17:05.589 --> 17:08.849
I've failed to live up to your trust,
Seventh Grandmother.

17:08.920 --> 17:09.750
Today,

17:10.589 --> 17:13.270
I'll return this seal to you,
Seventh Grandmother,

17:13.270 --> 17:17.670
and step down from the authority over
the inner household and the ink workshop.

17:19.510 --> 17:20.510
Zhen.

17:21.109 --> 17:22.109
Stand up.

17:23.750 --> 17:24.720
Stand up.

17:25.109 --> 17:27.109
I have something to say to you.

17:34.240 --> 17:37.160
I won't allow you
to speak of yourself like that.

17:38.310 --> 17:41.350
I, your old grandmother,
had a long, good sleep,

17:41.350 --> 17:42.590
and when I woke up,

17:43.350 --> 17:44.440
our Li Ink

17:44.790 --> 17:45.920
and Li family

17:46.480 --> 17:48.480
were doing wonderfully.

17:48.880 --> 17:52.010
We have so many orders now
we can hardly keep up with them.

17:52.590 --> 17:54.480
And look at your Uncle Jingdong.

17:55.070 --> 17:57.640
He's like
a completely different person now.

17:59.640 --> 18:01.110
Over at the Literary Association,

18:01.110 --> 18:02.920
whenever people mention you, Manager Zhen,

18:02.920 --> 18:05.920
everyone knows your name and admires you.

18:06.640 --> 18:08.750
This situation was opened up

18:08.960 --> 18:11.310
by your own hard work.

18:12.240 --> 18:14.440
But if I hadn't managed this household,

18:14.510 --> 18:17.240
it wouldn't have provoked
Fourth Aunt's hatred.

18:17.310 --> 18:18.720
And that Li Decai—

18:18.830 --> 18:20.550
it was also because
I softened for a moment

18:20.550 --> 18:22.310
and let him into the ink workshop

18:22.310 --> 18:24.350
that I gave him an opportunity
to take advantage of us.

18:24.350 --> 18:25.750
Zhen.

18:26.400 --> 18:27.680
People's hearts

18:27.680 --> 18:29.680
all have their wrinkles and twists.

18:29.720 --> 18:30.680
But you

18:30.830 --> 18:32.750
are an open and straightforward person,

18:32.750 --> 18:35.880
without all those hidden schemes
and winding thoughts.

18:35.880 --> 18:37.070
You treat others

18:37.310 --> 18:39.110
with genuine sincerity.

18:39.880 --> 18:43.400
I only want to remind you of one thing:

18:44.110 --> 18:46.400
in the future, whenever something happens,

18:46.400 --> 18:50.550
think just a little bit further ahead.

18:51.110 --> 18:52.270
I understand.

18:54.790 --> 18:56.640
I know

18:57.830 --> 18:59.160
my own condition.

19:00.680 --> 19:02.350
It's impossible

19:03.200 --> 19:04.860
for me to recover completely.

19:11.510 --> 19:12.720
Zhen.

19:13.920 --> 19:15.270
I want you

19:15.920 --> 19:17.920
to continue

19:18.550 --> 19:20.440
holding this family together.

19:22.310 --> 19:23.350
Can you do that?

19:24.550 --> 19:26.000
If the Li family needs me,

19:26.200 --> 19:27.730
then of course I'm willing.

19:28.550 --> 19:29.960
It's just that
for the position of manager,

19:29.960 --> 19:31.440
there's Eldest Aunt overseeing
the inner household

19:31.440 --> 19:33.160
and Uncle Jingdong
managing external affairs.

19:33.160 --> 19:35.550
It wouldn't be right for me
to keep holding onto the position.

19:35.550 --> 19:36.440
Zhen.

19:37.790 --> 19:40.720
It was mainly your credit that Li Ink

19:41.350 --> 19:43.410
managed to avert disaster this time.

19:43.590 --> 19:46.590
I, Jingdong, thank you

19:47.400 --> 19:48.860
on behalf of the Li family.

19:49.070 --> 19:50.680
So this position of manager

19:50.830 --> 19:52.830
must be yours.

19:53.830 --> 19:57.480
I've made countless mistakes
over the course of half my life.

19:57.880 --> 20:00.110
I'm too ashamed to be the manager.

20:01.160 --> 20:02.510
And your Eldest Aunt

20:03.030 --> 20:04.960
has Zhengyou to take care of,

20:04.960 --> 20:06.790
so she has no time to spare.

20:07.480 --> 20:08.510
So,

20:09.200 --> 20:11.750
please continue to be the manager, okay?

20:11.750 --> 20:15.010
Today, it's not just
your Seventh Grandmother asking you—

20:16.200 --> 20:19.350
I'm asking you too. Is that alright?

20:36.550 --> 20:40.080
Since Seventh Grandmother
and Uncle Jingdong trust me so much,

20:41.400 --> 20:43.030
I will continue to do it.

21:00.640 --> 21:01.880
In this whole world,

21:02.160 --> 21:03.310
besides my mother,

21:03.350 --> 21:04.640
only you and Seventh Grandmother

21:04.640 --> 21:06.680
still remember what I like to eat,
Eldest Aunt.

21:06.680 --> 21:08.880
I'll make it for you often in the future.

21:10.510 --> 21:11.400
Eldest Aunt.

21:11.510 --> 21:12.550
It's actually perfect timing.

21:12.550 --> 21:14.550
I have something to discuss with you
today.

21:14.550 --> 21:15.590
What is it?

21:17.600 --> 21:19.200
The children of our Li family

21:19.240 --> 21:20.920
are different from other families.

21:20.920 --> 21:22.750
Since childhood, besides going to school,

21:22.750 --> 21:24.750
they also have to work
in the ink workshop.

21:24.750 --> 21:26.550
Even if they don't enter
the ink industry in the future,

21:26.550 --> 21:29.750
they should have an understanding
of the foundation of the Li family.

21:29.750 --> 21:30.720
I was thinking,

21:30.830 --> 21:33.000
Zhengyou has now come of age.

21:33.310 --> 21:34.720
If you're willing,

21:34.960 --> 21:37.070
how about letting him enter
the ink workshop?

21:37.070 --> 21:39.720
I'd be willing to teach him personally.

21:41.000 --> 21:43.400
Zhengyou is a fine child
raised under your guidance.

21:43.400 --> 21:44.550
He's kind-hearted,

21:44.590 --> 21:45.640
thoughtful,

21:45.640 --> 21:47.350
and gracious in the way he handles things.

21:47.350 --> 21:49.920
If you're willing to let him
endure some hardship, Eldest Aunt,

21:49.920 --> 21:52.070
he'll surely carve out a place of his own

21:52.070 --> 21:53.930
in the ink industry in the future.

21:54.680 --> 21:56.790
I'm willing. How could I not be?

21:57.000 --> 21:59.590
I'm relieved that he can learn from you.

22:01.030 --> 22:02.750
It's just that kid is naughty,

22:03.480 --> 22:05.070
and you've been so busy lately.

22:05.070 --> 22:07.110
I'm worried he'll cause you trouble.

22:07.110 --> 22:08.110
It's okay.

22:08.350 --> 22:09.550
Let him first follow me

22:09.550 --> 22:12.480
around the ink workshop,
observe things, and learn.

22:12.960 --> 22:14.640
The skill I have for identifying ink today

22:14.640 --> 22:15.200
was learned this very way—

22:15.200 --> 22:17.510
by following my father and grandfather
around when I was young.

22:17.510 --> 22:19.000
When he grows a bit older,

22:19.030 --> 22:22.230
I'll teach him how to twist lamp wicks
and make lampblack.

22:22.310 --> 22:24.920
This craft of mine was taught to me
personally by my grandfather.

22:24.920 --> 22:26.880
No one in the entire ink workshop
can compare to me.

22:26.880 --> 22:28.270
Of course I know.

22:37.750 --> 22:39.480
I'm truly ashamed.

22:40.720 --> 22:42.510
I did things that wronged you,

22:42.920 --> 22:44.980
yet you still think of us all the time.

22:48.400 --> 22:49.310
Zhen.

22:50.440 --> 22:51.880
I came here today

22:51.880 --> 22:53.920
to formally apologize to you.

22:54.070 --> 22:55.640
It was my fault.

22:55.750 --> 22:57.200
I made a mistake.

22:58.240 --> 22:59.400
It's all in the past.

22:59.750 --> 23:00.640
Eldest Aunt,

23:00.720 --> 23:02.400
I never took it to heart.

23:03.550 --> 23:04.590
Isn't being a family

23:04.590 --> 23:07.480
all about owing and repaying one another?

23:08.070 --> 23:09.200
Whether it's gratitude

23:09.200 --> 23:10.110
or resentment,

23:10.270 --> 23:11.670
the more entangled it is,

23:11.790 --> 23:13.320
the more it makes us family.

23:15.960 --> 23:17.360
Please sit, Eldest Aunt.

23:17.400 --> 23:17.960
Come on.

23:18.270 --> 23:18.930
Please sit.

23:21.750 --> 23:23.510
Your cooking skills

23:23.590 --> 23:25.450
are even better than my mother's.

23:26.270 --> 23:28.470
I'll make it for you often in the future.

23:29.790 --> 23:31.270
No crying, Eldest Aunt.

23:31.310 --> 23:32.880
Today is a happy occasion.

23:32.880 --> 23:34.480
Let's both be cheerful.

23:34.880 --> 23:35.720
Okay.

23:39.750 --> 23:40.680
It's delicious.

23:44.590 --> 23:47.590
Zhengyou, let me see it first.

23:47.750 --> 23:49.680
This is the first time
I've ever successfully made lampblack.

23:49.680 --> 23:52.070
Of course I have to show it to Zhen
right away.

23:52.070 --> 23:54.200
I want to learn lampblack-making too.

23:54.680 --> 23:55.440
You?

23:55.480 --> 23:56.110
Wait until you grow tall enough

23:56.110 --> 23:58.570
to reach the lampblack-making table first.

23:58.960 --> 23:59.830
Zhen.

23:59.830 --> 24:01.480
-Zhen.
-Zhen.

24:03.310 --> 24:04.920
I made my own lampblack.

24:05.110 --> 24:06.440
You made this yourself?

24:07.240 --> 24:09.790
Zhengyou made this lampblack himself.

24:13.270 --> 24:14.110
Zhengyou.

24:14.270 --> 24:15.880
I once taught you

24:15.880 --> 24:18.240
what makes good lampblack.

24:19.270 --> 24:21.160
It must be deep black in color

24:21.310 --> 24:23.640
and fine in texture to be considered good.

24:24.440 --> 24:25.240
Zhen,

24:25.350 --> 24:27.160
my heat control isn't good enough,

24:27.160 --> 24:28.070
is it?

24:30.030 --> 24:31.720
You still have a long way to go.

24:32.550 --> 24:33.550
Oh, you.

24:35.640 --> 24:36.480
Zhengyou.

24:36.680 --> 24:38.200
Although this lampblack

24:38.200 --> 24:39.790
isn't top-tier,

24:39.920 --> 24:42.350
it's your first time making it.

24:42.440 --> 24:44.200
It's worth remembering and encouraging.

24:44.200 --> 24:45.070
Very good.

24:46.440 --> 24:47.000
Come on.

24:47.110 --> 24:49.160
Today, I'll tell you

24:49.270 --> 24:51.000
the stories of our grandfathers
making ink.

24:51.000 --> 24:51.590
How about that?

24:51.590 --> 24:52.520
-Great.
-Great.

24:55.200 --> 24:56.070
Zhen.

24:56.110 --> 24:58.310
Just because they didn't make
good lampblack,

24:58.310 --> 25:00.310
did Eighth Master really
make Uncle Jingdong

25:00.310 --> 25:02.880
and Uncle Jingfu stand in the snow

25:02.880 --> 25:04.590
for a whole day?

25:04.640 --> 25:05.550
Yes.

25:06.680 --> 25:08.400
Zhengyou, tell me,

25:08.440 --> 25:10.240
why did they fail to make good lampblack?

25:10.240 --> 25:13.200
Uncle Jingdong and Uncle Jingfu
failed to make good lampblack

25:13.200 --> 25:15.000
because it was snowing outside.

25:15.070 --> 25:17.110
When it snows, it's colder than usual
in the smoke shed,

25:17.110 --> 25:18.750
so when lighting the soot,

25:19.070 --> 25:21.640
the oil temperature has to be
a bit higher than normal.

25:21.640 --> 25:22.590
Exactly.

25:22.750 --> 25:23.400
I get it now.

25:23.400 --> 25:24.830
I'll go make another bowl.

25:24.830 --> 25:25.880
No need to rush.

25:27.240 --> 25:29.310
Zhen, I get it too.

25:29.310 --> 25:32.550
I'll go make lampblack together
with Zhengyou.

25:32.550 --> 25:33.480
Okay.

25:33.590 --> 25:34.240
Go ahead.

25:34.920 --> 25:35.960
Be careful.

25:37.880 --> 25:39.240
Slow down.

25:41.110 --> 25:41.920
Eldest Aunt.

25:41.960 --> 25:42.830
Zhen.

25:43.350 --> 25:45.350
Did Zhengyou cause any trouble?

25:46.030 --> 25:47.310
I was just about to tell you.

25:47.310 --> 25:48.110
Look.

25:49.200 --> 25:50.480
Zhengyou made this.

25:53.680 --> 25:55.400
Is this really Zhengyou's work?

25:55.400 --> 25:57.750
It's thanks to how well
you taught him before, Eldest Aunt.

25:57.750 --> 25:59.880
He's smart and learns quickly.

26:00.110 --> 26:01.970
It's because you taught him well.

26:03.720 --> 26:04.510
Zhen.

26:05.500 --> 26:07.070
It's the Start of Winter today.

26:07.070 --> 26:08.200
When you go home,

26:08.200 --> 26:10.440
invite your Grandfather and Mother over.

26:10.440 --> 26:13.550
Your Seventh Grandmother prepared
a winter-welcoming feast personally.

26:13.550 --> 26:14.720
Let's all have a proper

26:14.720 --> 26:16.650
reunion meal together as a family.

27:48.510 --> 27:49.510
Aunt Rujun.

27:53.310 --> 27:54.480
I, Jin,

27:56.480 --> 27:57.440
am back.

27:59.720 --> 28:04.030
It's great to have you back.

28:50.590 --> 28:51.440
Rujun.

28:51.790 --> 28:53.750
I knew you'd be here.

28:54.460 --> 28:55.450
You've only just come back—

28:55.450 --> 28:57.480
why did you run off
to busy yourself in the kitchen?

28:57.480 --> 28:59.750
You should be spending time
talking properly with Mother instead.

28:59.750 --> 29:00.680
Sister-in-law.

29:00.790 --> 29:02.680
If I let you serve me food and tea,

29:02.920 --> 29:05.200
then I'd still feel like an outsider.

29:05.750 --> 29:08.110
Only when I'm working in the kitchen

29:08.110 --> 29:09.110
and making dishes

29:09.510 --> 29:10.680
do I truly feel like

29:10.960 --> 29:12.310
I've come home.

29:13.350 --> 29:15.000
No, you have to listen to me today.

29:15.000 --> 29:15.480
Come on.

29:16.270 --> 29:17.200
Sister-in-law.

29:17.640 --> 29:19.000
To be honest with you guys,

29:19.000 --> 29:20.160
it's been years

29:20.160 --> 29:22.510
since I last cooked in a kitchen this big.

29:23.440 --> 29:24.200
Today,

29:24.200 --> 29:25.480
leave the cooking to me.

29:25.480 --> 29:26.680
You go wait outside.

29:27.200 --> 29:28.030
Go wait outside.

29:28.030 --> 29:28.960
Just wait to eat.

29:28.960 --> 29:29.790
Go on ahead.

29:30.550 --> 29:31.640
You can trust me.

29:31.640 --> 29:32.880
Thank you for your trouble then.

29:32.880 --> 29:33.810
It's no trouble.

29:37.930 --> 29:39.440
The reunion hot pot is here!

29:39.440 --> 29:41.010
The reunion hot pot is here!

29:42.830 --> 29:44.960
This chicken was killed by my mother.

29:45.040 --> 29:46.130
The winter bamboo shoots inside

29:46.130 --> 29:47.880
were picked by Zhengshen
from the mountains.

29:47.880 --> 29:49.750
The ham was brought from
my mother's hometown

29:49.750 --> 29:50.960
in Yi County.

29:51.160 --> 29:52.440
And these cured ribs

29:52.550 --> 29:54.400
were personally marinated by Eldest Aunt.

29:54.400 --> 29:55.400
Come on, try them.

29:56.270 --> 29:57.510
Manager Zhen,

29:57.680 --> 30:00.480
may I say a few words?

30:00.960 --> 30:02.820
Of course, Seventh Grandmother.

30:02.920 --> 30:03.400
Okay.

30:03.510 --> 30:04.110
Then I...

30:04.110 --> 30:05.550
I-I'll stand up to speak.

30:05.750 --> 30:06.480
Alright.

30:08.510 --> 30:09.680
Today is

30:09.880 --> 30:11.200
the Start of Winter.

30:11.590 --> 30:13.720
On such a special day,

30:15.510 --> 30:16.880
our Li family

30:17.790 --> 30:19.480
is all gathered together,

30:20.440 --> 30:21.900
sitting here in one place.

30:23.270 --> 30:27.160
I just hope everyone can drink this cup

30:27.400 --> 30:29.110
and share in this moment of
harmony and joy.

30:29.110 --> 30:31.070
-Hear, hear.
-Hear, hear.

30:35.310 --> 30:36.880
Alright, drink up.

30:40.590 --> 30:41.790
Okay, everyone sit down.

30:41.790 --> 30:42.160
Come on.

30:42.160 --> 30:43.050
Let's start eating.

30:43.050 --> 30:43.720
Start eating.

30:43.720 --> 30:44.720
Try these dishes.

30:45.640 --> 30:46.110
Okay.

30:46.110 --> 30:46.880
Qiu'e,

30:47.200 --> 30:48.720
when are you due?

30:48.960 --> 30:50.110
Counting the days,

30:50.160 --> 30:52.110
it should be sometime after
the Start of Spring.

30:52.110 --> 30:53.310
That's a good time.

30:53.370 --> 30:55.160
This child will surely be blessed.

30:55.160 --> 30:55.960
Indeed.

30:56.030 --> 30:56.880
Zhengliang,

30:57.200 --> 30:59.200
your inkstone-making is top-tier.

30:59.270 --> 31:03.110
People have even approached me
saying they want to buy inkstones from you.

31:03.110 --> 31:04.840
Not at all. It's just passable.

31:05.240 --> 31:06.510
It's not just passable.

31:06.510 --> 31:08.640
You're a chief manager now.

31:08.680 --> 31:10.440
Zhengliang's business is doing
really well.

31:10.440 --> 31:11.070
I heard

31:11.070 --> 31:12.750
an inkstone this big

31:12.750 --> 31:13.770
had been ordered by someone.

31:13.770 --> 31:14.620
Is that so?

31:16.230 --> 31:17.630
Learn from him, will you?

31:17.680 --> 31:18.550
Well,

31:18.680 --> 31:20.070
on this joyous day,

31:20.640 --> 31:21.920
my father

31:21.960 --> 31:23.920
has a big announcement to make.

31:23.920 --> 31:24.980
Am I right, Father?

31:29.830 --> 31:30.510
Yes.

31:31.520 --> 31:34.170
I've held this in my heart
for a long time.

31:34.350 --> 31:38.350
I've been thinking about this
ever since the ink workshop was repaired.

31:44.920 --> 31:45.750
Aunt Rujun,

31:46.640 --> 31:47.440
Eighth Uncle.

31:48.720 --> 31:49.720
It's time

31:50.110 --> 31:52.510
to let the Eighth Branch
return to the clan.

31:55.030 --> 31:55.920
Jinshui,

31:58.030 --> 31:59.160
think about it.

31:59.830 --> 32:02.640
Now that Jingdong's come to terms with it,

32:03.270 --> 32:04.590
shouldn't you

32:05.160 --> 32:06.920
give him an answer?

32:24.070 --> 32:24.960
Rujun,

32:27.880 --> 32:28.680
Jingdong.

32:35.110 --> 32:36.480
Thirteen years ago,

32:37.270 --> 32:38.930
the failure of the Tribute Ink

32:39.720 --> 32:42.050
was indeed the fault of the Eighth Branch.

32:42.680 --> 32:45.810
The Eighth Branch requested
to be removed from the clan.

32:46.480 --> 32:49.590
I, Li Jinshui, failed the Li family first.

32:51.160 --> 32:53.790
I once made a vow:

32:54.400 --> 32:56.000
unless this sin is redeemed,

32:56.830 --> 32:57.830
the Eighth Branch

32:58.510 --> 33:00.170
will never return to the clan.

33:04.350 --> 33:05.240
Jingdong,

33:07.640 --> 33:08.550
Rujun.

33:09.720 --> 33:13.160
It's not that
I'm stubborn or unreasonable.

33:16.510 --> 33:17.790
For the past 13 years,

33:18.440 --> 33:21.270
do you think I haven't
thought about it day and night,

33:21.270 --> 33:23.030
dreaming of the day

33:24.920 --> 33:26.580
I could lead the Eighth Branch

33:28.790 --> 33:31.650
to acknowledge our ancestry
and return to the clan?

33:32.270 --> 33:35.350
But besides guilt,

33:36.030 --> 33:38.090
there's also resentment in my heart.

33:39.240 --> 33:42.440
Our Li family's calamity began with
the Tribute Ink case.

33:42.960 --> 33:46.160
Over these 13 years,
we've endured countless hardships.

33:48.480 --> 33:49.540
Though I, Jinshui,

33:50.480 --> 33:51.680
am already old

33:52.160 --> 33:54.680
and once swore never to make ink again,

33:57.680 --> 33:58.680
now

34:01.420 --> 34:03.820
I'm willing to stake what remains
of my life

34:07.270 --> 34:08.230
to help Jingdong

34:11.760 --> 34:13.070
and our Zhen

34:15.000 --> 34:17.260
regain the right to produce Tribute Ink.

34:18.550 --> 34:20.360
The day the right to produce Tribute Ink

34:20.360 --> 34:22.110
returns to the Li family

34:24.230 --> 34:25.830
will be the day I, Li Jinshui,

34:26.590 --> 34:27.670
return to the clan.

34:45.840 --> 34:46.760
Sit.

34:48.190 --> 34:49.070
Grandfather,

34:49.630 --> 34:50.889
Seventh Grandmother,

34:51.000 --> 34:52.000
Uncle Jingdong.

34:52.880 --> 34:54.920
No matter when
we formally return to the clan,

34:54.920 --> 34:57.110
the fact that we can all sit together

34:57.230 --> 34:58.490
and share this meal now

34:58.960 --> 35:01.190
already means our hearts

35:01.320 --> 35:02.780
have long since come home.

35:03.630 --> 35:04.670
Isn't a family

35:05.070 --> 35:07.150
simply the hearts of people
gathered together?

35:07.150 --> 35:08.080
Don't you agree?

35:08.590 --> 35:10.030
Zhen is right.

35:12.630 --> 35:13.840
And Uncle Jingdong,

35:14.590 --> 35:16.030
you must promise me.

35:16.030 --> 35:17.360
After eating this reunion pot,

35:17.360 --> 35:20.710
you have to join me in
the next Tribute Ink selection.

35:20.810 --> 35:22.810
I'd be delighted to. Truly delighted.

35:22.810 --> 35:24.730
Zhen, I want to join you too.

35:25.010 --> 35:26.110
You want to join me too?

35:26.110 --> 35:26.480
Sure.

35:26.480 --> 35:27.280
Zhen,

35:27.280 --> 35:28.320
I want to eat too.

35:28.660 --> 35:30.950
Do you want to eat or join?

35:31.760 --> 35:33.030
Little Run.

35:33.030 --> 35:34.550
Hurry up and eat.

35:34.630 --> 35:36.880
Once you're done, I'm going to test you

35:36.880 --> 35:38.280
on ink-making.

35:39.070 --> 35:40.880
If you win first place,

35:41.000 --> 35:42.670
there'll be a huge reward for you.

35:42.670 --> 35:43.360
Okay.

35:44.630 --> 35:45.360
Run,

35:45.360 --> 35:47.230
you'd better identify the ink carefully.

35:47.230 --> 35:49.070
Back when I was identifying ink,

35:49.110 --> 35:50.710
I recognized the ink

35:52.110 --> 35:54.110
my father made the moment I saw it.

35:54.320 --> 35:56.050
I'll drink a cup as punishment.

36:16.220 --> 36:18.150
Master, the ink workshop
has paid out the money.

36:18.150 --> 36:21.350
Manager Zhen told me to collect all of it
and bring it over.

36:23.400 --> 36:24.240
Master,

36:24.710 --> 36:25.550
look.

36:26.190 --> 36:28.030
This portion here
is Li Ink's share of the profits.

36:28.030 --> 36:30.960
Manager Zhen specifically asked me
to give it to you.

36:33.000 --> 36:34.260
Manager Zhen also said

36:34.280 --> 36:35.360
that these past days,

36:35.360 --> 36:38.760
you worked so hard to buy pine yards
and get ink orders everywhere.

36:38.760 --> 36:40.440
It's been exhausting
both physically and mentally.

36:40.440 --> 36:41.800
You've truly worked hard

36:41.800 --> 36:44.000
and rendered great service to Li Ink.

36:44.150 --> 36:44.800
So Manager Zhen

36:44.800 --> 36:48.260
specially awarded you a large bonus
on top of everything else.

36:50.710 --> 36:52.190
I didn't expect a bonus.

36:53.550 --> 36:56.030
That's really generous of Zhen.

36:56.150 --> 36:56.920
Master,

36:57.320 --> 36:58.630
with this bonus,

36:58.880 --> 37:00.610
plus the dividends from Li Ink,

37:00.840 --> 37:03.000
it's more than enough to cover
the military funding gap.

37:03.000 --> 37:04.460
We even have some to spare.

37:04.760 --> 37:06.760
Now we can report back to General.

37:15.030 --> 37:16.150
Where's Miss Li Zhen?

37:16.150 --> 37:17.630
Today is the Start of Winter.

37:17.630 --> 37:20.160
Of course she went to reunite
with her family.

37:23.630 --> 37:24.690
By the way, Master.

37:26.070 --> 37:28.670
Just now, Cuiqiao sent someone
with a message,

37:28.840 --> 37:29.920
asking you to visit her tonight

37:29.920 --> 37:31.400
to discuss the follow-up matters

37:31.400 --> 37:34.070
regarding Yihousheng.

37:35.000 --> 37:36.630
This is the ejiao

37:36.630 --> 37:38.800
you told me to buy for Cuiqiao.

37:38.800 --> 37:40.150
I went through a lot of trouble

37:40.150 --> 37:42.590
to get this from
a local traveling merchant.

37:42.590 --> 37:44.110
With the end of the year approaching,

37:44.110 --> 37:45.110
this stuff

37:45.110 --> 37:46.230
is really hard to find.

37:46.230 --> 37:46.960
Alright.

37:48.960 --> 37:50.760
We're leaving this little room,

37:51.880 --> 37:53.510
and we're leaving Li Ink.

37:54.360 --> 37:55.510
With Miss Li Zhen here,

37:55.510 --> 37:57.110
what's there to worry about?

38:02.630 --> 38:03.320
Master,

38:04.510 --> 38:07.510
are we going back to Yihousheng or not?

38:21.400 --> 38:23.840
I didn't expect you to make up for

38:24.110 --> 38:26.400
the military supplies deficit
in such a short time, Wenqian.

38:26.400 --> 38:27.800
I wasn't wrong about you.

38:28.400 --> 38:30.030
Neither was General.

38:33.070 --> 38:34.760
Now that you're returning to Yihousheng,

38:34.760 --> 38:36.000
what are your plans?

38:37.110 --> 38:39.920
Of course I'll find a way
to keep bringing down the Tian family

38:39.920 --> 38:42.070
to avenge Master, Eldest Young Master,

38:42.070 --> 38:43.400
and Young Mistress.

38:46.230 --> 38:48.490
Even wontons can't keep your mouth shut.

38:48.800 --> 38:50.260
Sister wasn't asking you.

38:53.760 --> 38:54.670
I was asking you.

38:54.670 --> 38:56.190
So say something already.

39:03.960 --> 39:05.550
You're hesitating.

39:06.360 --> 39:08.710
Having spent all this time with Zhen,

39:09.110 --> 39:11.040
you can't bear to leave her, right?

39:17.000 --> 39:17.960
Sister.

39:20.320 --> 39:21.550
Zhen

39:21.550 --> 39:24.840
is kind and pure,

39:26.880 --> 39:28.630
like a suxin orchid,

39:30.110 --> 39:32.400
growing tenaciously even in adversity.

39:34.800 --> 39:36.320
After the storms pass,

39:36.670 --> 39:38.600
she blooms even more brilliantly,

39:40.760 --> 39:43.890
as if there has always been
a beam of light shining on her.

39:45.550 --> 39:47.000
And that light…

39:48.840 --> 39:50.280
makes me deeply envious.

39:55.920 --> 39:59.720
But with an identity like mine,
one that can never stand in the light,

40:00.320 --> 40:02.180
how would I dare expect anything?

40:06.030 --> 40:07.110
Actually...

40:09.840 --> 40:12.150
Actually, I also quite like Zhen.

40:12.550 --> 40:13.750
Logically speaking,

40:14.320 --> 40:15.480
since you like her,

40:16.030 --> 40:18.090
I should support it wholeheartedly.

40:18.320 --> 40:19.840
But just as you said,

40:20.550 --> 40:22.280
when you know it won't work out,

40:23.590 --> 40:25.710
it's better not to fall in too deeply.

40:37.680 --> 40:38.850
The deeds.

40:38.880 --> 40:41.230
Give me all of Yihousheng's deeds.

40:42.590 --> 40:43.480
Wait here.

40:59.000 --> 41:03.830
[Hui Ink, Loyal Heart]

41:37.640 --> 41:39.080
Seventh Old Madam, please take a look.

41:38.970 --> 41:40.180
[Invitation from the Princess's household
for the Birthday Inkstick Commission]

41:40.480 --> 41:43.870
This is an invitation
from Princess Shouyang of Nanjing.

41:45.510 --> 41:48.030
The birthday of Princess Shouyang's
birth mother, Noble Consort Du,

41:48.030 --> 41:49.110
is approaching,

41:49.630 --> 41:50.960
and Princess Shouyang

41:51.230 --> 41:54.670
wants to find an ink workshop
that is both capable

41:54.710 --> 41:56.510
and innovative

41:56.840 --> 41:59.640
to produce a special batch of
birthday inksticks.

42:00.430 --> 42:02.390
As soon as this news came out,

42:03.110 --> 42:06.110
every county with an ink-making industry

42:06.360 --> 42:08.590
is fighting for this opportunity.

42:10.110 --> 42:11.190
I figured that

42:11.920 --> 42:13.120
since the Tian family

42:13.670 --> 42:15.280
holds the Tribute Ink rights,

42:15.280 --> 42:17.510
they'll naturally have a share in it.

42:17.760 --> 42:19.480
But as the Ink Affairs Official,

42:19.480 --> 42:21.550
I'm also allowed to recommend
one more workshop,

42:21.550 --> 42:24.190
so I came specifically to ask you this—

42:24.400 --> 42:25.320
would the Li family

42:25.320 --> 42:29.320
be willing to make a trip to Nanjing
for this?

42:35.000 --> 42:37.800
Thank you for your care, Lord Yan.

42:38.400 --> 42:41.400
Since you're sincerely
recommending us, Lord Yan,

42:41.710 --> 42:45.030
of course our Li Ink is willing to
do its part

42:45.070 --> 42:46.960
for Huizhou's ink industry.

42:48.150 --> 42:49.230
However,

42:49.920 --> 42:51.190
going to Nanjing

42:52.210 --> 42:54.840
to compete for
the birthday inkstick commission

42:54.840 --> 42:56.590
is a major matter.

42:57.230 --> 42:58.320
Lord Yan.

42:58.440 --> 43:01.190
We'll need to carefully discuss

43:01.230 --> 43:02.960
and weigh it within the Li family

43:02.960 --> 43:04.550
before we can give you a proper reply.
